name: zfs-gui
version: "@VERSION@"
origin: sysutils/zfs-gui
comment: "ZFS management GUI for FreeBSD (zpool / zfs / bectl)"
desc: <<EOD
A GTK4 desktop application for managing OpenZFS on FreeBSD.

Features:
 - Storage pool overview with vdev tree, health, scrub and TRIM
 - Dataset tree with properties, quotas and mount control
 - Snapshots: recursive/system snapshot, rollback, clone, hold, diff
 - Send/receive with live backup progress and file picker
 - Boot environments (bectl)
 - Command center with 87 whitelisted operations
 - Privileged daemon + PAM re-authentication for dangerous operations
 - Chinese help page documenting every feature

The GUI connects to the root daemon zfs-guid over a local UNIX socket.
Dangerous operations require re-authentication with an administrator
password (PAM), and every command is validated against a whitelist.
EOD
maintainer: "zfs-gui contributors"
www: "https://github.com/"
categories: [sysutils]
licenses: [BSD2CLAUSE]
prefix: /usr/local
abi: "@ABI@"
deps: {
  gtk4: {
    origin: "x11-toolkits/gtk40",
    version: "@GTK4_VERSION@"
  }
  glib: {
    origin: "devel/glib20",
    version: "@GLIB_VERSION@"
  }
}
message: <<EOD
ZFS 管理工具已安装。

  服务：sysrc zfsguid_enable=YES 已设置，并已尝试启动
        service zfsguid status
  配置：/usr/local/etc/zfs-gui.conf
  认证：/usr/local/etc/pam.d/zfs-gui
  程序：zfs-gui（桌面菜单或命令启动）

注意：zfs-guid 必须以 root 运行；普通用户需在 wheel 组，或在
配置文件的 allowed_users / allowed_groups 中。
EOD
